{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05174","headline":"奉别张岳州说二首 二 · 王熊","name":"奉别张岳州说二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平生共风月，倏忽间山川。\n不期交淡水，暂得欵忘年。\n兴逸方罢钓，帆开欲解船。\n离心若危斾，朝夕爲君悬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王熊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05174.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05174","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}